  "description": "Tildom.Extensions provides a collection of extension methods for .NET, including DateTime operations, collection utilities, string manipulation, file operations, and advanced utilities like DeepClone and DeepCompare for working with complex object graphs. The library offers robust handling of edge cases, memory optimization through Span/Memory APIs, and detailed diagnostics. Note: The library contains experimental extensions and may introduce breaking changes without warning.",
